### Block 9 - Bulk updates and the persistence context
### Select the "local" environment.

### Bulk update WITHOUT clearing the persistence context
### Q: the database says active=false. What does em.find() return? Why?
POST {{host}}/demo/bulk?clear=false

### Same bulk update with clearAutomatically = true
### Q: why does em.find() now see the real value?
### Q: what is the state of the object we were holding (productIsStillManaged)?
POST {{host}}/demo/bulk?clear=true

### The real endpoint: one UPDATE, no entity loaded (see ProductRepository)
### First make a product without stock:
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Out of stock thing",
  "stock": 0
}

### Deactivate all the products without stock
POST {{host}}/products/deactivate-without-stock

### Check the "active" flag
GET {{host}}/products
